[{"title":"泊江口树下寄周澹园","author":"王又旦","text":"长川望不极，渡口问吴艭。\n白鹤起高树，青山阴半江。\n秋花垂屋角，水荇落船窗。\n为报南康好，殷勤鲤一双。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6502,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"亭上","author":"王又旦","text":"坦步章丘上，苔华处处斑。\n青林红几叶，九月下黄湾。\n天坼禺东地，潮吞海上山。\n故人家在此，开卷对孱颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6503,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿花首台","author":"王又旦","text":"乱石夹奔湍，我行随意深。\n选胜崎岖间，幽人多苦心。\n云堕竹篙岭，流影松树林。\n葱茏翳山翠，不知西日沈。\n取径行木杪，花宫在层岑。\n细泉天上来，苔阶有清音。\n夜气湛虚明，真源疑可寻。\n泠然不成寐，高风吹短襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6504,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望水帘洞","author":"王又旦","text":"老人峰下路，乱瀑对清秋。\n小憩云中树，遥看石上流。\n风声传海峤，雨脚下循州。\n从此扪萝去，青天倚二楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6505,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冲虚观","author":"王又旦","text":"我寻鲍公履，因之登翠微。\n仙人不可见，海燕西南飞。\n灌木蟠长根，清樾当门扇。\n洞中自昏昼，日月安所归。\n巑岏四百峰，高下相因依。\n玄气结重云，山云漭相围。\n服食宁所愿，庶免为人鞿。\n徘徊暝色下，冷露沾裳衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6506,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"招隐桥与周澹园","author":"王又旦","text":"下马玩密绿，山静闻激湍。\n与子坐石桥，风入青琅玕。\n是时望鹤鸣，峰名。\n亏蔽松林端。\n初日上左蠡，气势高且寒。\n古人耻束带，鸿毛视一官。\n遗徽传今古，慷慨诚为难。\n吾谓守不固，一出良足叹。\n故里有名胜，何事他盘桓。\n金庭郁参差，云气张绡纨。\n他年著书毕，直去骖青鸾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6507,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除日大雪登燕子矶","author":"王又旦","text":"野梅香入寺门烟，雪落亭皋正渺然。\n敢恨新年羁水国，谁能元日看江天。\n千寻翠壁迷僧舍，三尺银花拥画船。\n箧里红囊茶尚在，夜深活火手亲煎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6508,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朱圉山","author":"李念慈","text":"我过朱圉山，山势何缥缈。\n丹崖卧横纹，十里行未了。\n寒路风沙集，冰溪清渭绕。\n鸡犬叫云中，人家出树杪。\n天寒烟不上，道险壑方窈。\n移神探古迹，流目瞩去鸟。\n海内多战斗，河西尚征剿。\n苦为行迟迟，半是忧悄悄。\n云开西倾青，日出伏羌晓。\n问奇怀胼胝，寻幽披萝茑。\n因爱山中静，人世多纷扰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6509,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阿坝东山晚眺","author":"李念慈","text":"骑马到松岑，万绿渺无数。\n况有一片月，挂在西陵树。\n遥遥陟寒坂，披榛入广雾。\n乱山何累累，陵谷相回互。\n黄河自天来，巨波东南注。\n极目俯大荒，风沙千里暮。\n海内多战伐，边功竞驰骛。\n良马千队连，士卒百金募。\n联营卧冰霜，转输披寒露。\n杀伤不足论，策名良已误。\n我来经战地，鬼火照寒素。\n黄羊走沙碛，饥鹰啄狡兔。\n连峰接渺茫，落日边风怒。\n长林振响籁，空阿生深惧。\n持觞吊往昔，慷慨各相顾。\n寄语岭上儿，莫唱《丁都护》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6510,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登太华南峰绝顶谒上清宫还出四眺","author":"李念慈","text":"众山祖昆仑，五岳兹雄长。\n峭壁出青云，巍然俯群象。\n高标五千仞，三峰石非两。\n绝群迥独尊，赴天成孤往。\n窈窕玉女祠，仿佛巨灵掌。\n竭尽筋力能，驯致青冥上。\n短衣谒白帝，问源伫仙仗。\n海云东南生，夕日下林莽。\n偃仰天池侧，四顾爱森爽。\n学仙亦荒唐，驰思聊自广。\n何当营茅茨，洒然遗尘网。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6511,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦驻山观海","author":"李念慈","text":"秦皇并四海，飞剑骋雄略。\n穷极世上欲，还希神仙药。\n长城既西筑，骊山亦东作。\n巩图思万世，民生咸萧索。\n巨桥那可成，临望心旁礴。\n辒车载臭腐，驰道空寂寞。\n徒令鹤上人，大笑入寥廓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6512,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立春夜感怀","author":"李念兹","text":"闻道花门信，甘州今尚围。\n城分犹拒战，兵久未成归。\n刁斗连边动，军书入塞飞。\n客怀无一可，愁绝盼春晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6513,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登浮山","author":"李念兹","text":"绝顶凭谁引，苍藤乍可攀。\n偶然临福地，不信在人间。\n古洞遥通棹，江光日浸山。\n东南百战后，登眺泪潺湲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6514,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云","author":"李念兹","text":"片片浮云去，愁人正望乡。\n东风吹送汝，几日到咸阳？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6515,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"松江舟中","author":"李念慈","text":"松江过吴会，一道得安流。\n旭日轻乌动，和风细草抽。\n近城先见塔，入市尽通舟。\n柔橹春衫把，吴娘倚柁楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6516,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀张少参商于","author":"李念慈","text":"一官贫剧向商于，万里艰难事簿书。\n直北家音新得否，山南群盗近何如。\n秋空剑气张华宅，夜色星文扬子居。\n稍待西风溪水落，好将佳句付双鱼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6517,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日庄浪看雪","author":"李念慈","text":"萧萧风雪下千峦，客里相看泪不乾。\n欲典羊裘沽好酒，却愁明日又春寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6518,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九曲亭","author":"李念慈","text":"九曲亭犹好，樊山纵马蹄。\n人经赤壁水，燕带雪堂泥。\n词赋名空擅，川原草自萋。\n潘生遗法在，春酿过桥西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6519,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广州除夜","author":"李念慈","text":"屈指残今日，禁愁又一年。\n已知过少壮，不复惜婵娟。\n海色连铜柱，江春发木棉。\n殊方累多口，迢递限山川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6520,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚村","author":"郑梁","text":"一卷残经对好风，会心多在晚村中。\n已凭沟浍污流竞，自觉烟云色相空。\n古墓欹倾耕犊上，野桥低小钓航通。\n年来渐洗名根净，惟许前溪鸥鹭同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6521,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归家即事","author":"郑梁","text":"暂得离城市，归家事转清。\n移花乘细雨，插种急新晴。\n浪暖鱼儿出，烟浓杏子生。\n村居无俗客，随意听禽声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6522,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜泊燕子矶","author":"郑梁","text":"燕子矶头看月浪，观音阁上听风芦。\n但知意思凌天表，那记形骸滞客途。\n夜静钟声鸣不断，江长帆影过如无。\n何须别羡玄真子，泛宅浮家作钓徒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6523,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画长松呈梨洲先生","author":"郑梁","text":"峨峨千丈松，挺生蓝溪侧。\n种自新建来，根从蕺山出。\n耸身立云表，枝柯散八极。\n众芳仰广荫，攀援各努力。\n中有幽兰姿，细草愧弱植。\n瞻望徒殷勤，高卑不相及。\n松枝忽下垂，一朝承颜色。\n何以报长松，馨香保贞德。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6524,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晚","author":"郑梁","text":"斜阳平楚风烟乱，新月遥村鸡犬微。\n好与邻翁争席罢，其如客邸带愁归。\n疏萤暗落青苔井，野火孤明白板扉。\n多少惊心荣辱事，秋江拟付钓鱼矶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6525,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"郑梁","text":"久不登楼望，江天别样清。\n朔风寒有色，西日照多情。\n木落山馀骨，村空水作声。\n倚窗看未倦，林月一轮明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6526,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"娄庄晓行","author":"郑梁","text":"不知长夜不知冬，枣堡榆庄走兴浓。\n疲马单车十字路，青天明月五更钟。\n寒风自与严霜约，清气偏于瘦骨逢。\n今日京华肩准息，却嫌人事又环攻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6527,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郯城道上 其一","author":"郑梁","text":"村落无树木，鸟兽无羽毛。\n江淮数百里，弥望皆黄茅。\n山行入郯城，始复见柯条。\n枣色远苍郁，柳意寒萧骚。\n草屋枳篱中，犬声时囒囒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6528,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郯城道上 其二","author":"郑梁","text":"江淮日雨雪，入山天始晴。\n瀰然千里白，照日增光明。\n天无片云黑，野无寸草青。\n藐焉余一身，有若纤尘停。\n所以古达人，思与大化冥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6529,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郯城道上 其三","author":"郑梁","text":"病骨衰气血，瘦硬柴一把。\n晨征霜露寒，两脚痛如剐。\n局蹐一舆中，羡杀蓬门寡。\n鸡啼茅屋上，牛眠土墙下。\n从容指行人，云是南来者。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6530,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早发沭阳","author":"郑梁","text":"立春早起沭阳程，衾薄空舆梦不成。\n浅水无桥牵马渡，晓星如月照人行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6531,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望夫石","author":"郑梁","text":"万劫难灰伉俪心，舟中过客底愁侵。\n倚门两载嗟行役，知比冈头望更深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6532,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡黄河","author":"毛际可","text":"晨兴理轻策，咫尺阻长河。\n是时当伏秋，激浪涌嵯峨。\n中流风怒号，嘘吸愁鲸鼍。\n同侣皆动色，将伯欲如何。\n舟子谈笑馀，顾视颜愈和。\n扬帆复理楫，枕席恬然过。\n始知镇定力，可以靖风波。\n谋事苟若是，经营岂在多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6533,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙人沈香船歌","author":"毛际可","text":"仙人鼓棹空中举，飞上重岩斟桂醑。\n夜深沈醉堕岩前，忘却仙舟在何处。\n七尺寒玉凝紫脂，沈香之号恐传疑。\n波间似有蛟龙护，月落澄潭雾起时。\n至今陈迹已千载，苔纹藓绣生幽采。\n行人日日见仙舟，仙舟日见行人改。\n吁嗟乎！\n化工奇谲何所无，儒生鲜见徒惊呼。\n君不见昔人凿井逢篙楫，年月犹书吴赤乌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6534,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日游林虑观珍珠帘","author":"毛际可","text":"丹嶂何年剖，悬流万仞溪。\n峰晴留古雪，石怒抱寒霓。\n小径攀藤滑，危亭俯树低。\n天台差共拟，翘首石城西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6535,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游上黄华寺","author":"毛际可","text":"半日寻钟至，微茫路可求。\n岩危如欲坠，水缓不成流。\n草静栖寒鹿，林空集暮鸠。\n白云飞欲尽，月上碧山头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6536,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·冯太傅溥","author":"徐元文","text":"岳岳冯太傅，由来秉直伉。\n格心帷幄中，抗议岩廊上。\n两朝信贞笃，终以资弼亮。\n殷然去国心，矢谟一何壮。\n重谒属车尘，输忠永不忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6537,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·汤巡抚斌","author":"徐元文","text":"中丞荷道重，沉静寡物虑。\n致君托荩诚，推已得强恕。\n屹焉镇江国，清风畅晨曙。\n树表畏具僚，惇俗变黎庶。\n持用悦性情，非取要民誉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6538,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·徐总漕旭龄","author":"徐元文","text":"吾宗挺贤达，翛然美无度。\n抗志古人间，落落遗世务。\n登陛色不辱，宰物众所慕。\n再岁畀双节，一日芟百蠹。\n持情无激矫，适己但贞素。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6539,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·徐处士枋","author":"徐元文","text":"卓哉徐处士，皎节净如练。\n入山岂必深，尘迹自能断。\n载乘探幽奥，山川写英绚。\n独寤聊自歌，斯饥亦云宴。\n珍重式庐情，斯人不可见。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6540,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·陆知县陇其","author":"徐元文","text":"陆君任名教，学植固深基。\n秉礼自贞笃，执德无委随。\n鸣琴化不辍，尘甑固其宜。\n畜民如子弟，求理若渴饥。\n安得究儒术，树之为人师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6541,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·韩学士菼","author":"徐元文","text":"矫矫韩学士，高视薄浮壒。\n寡虑泊无营，立言道所赖。\n痛饮非徒然，寄赏不在外。\n物情任回遹，揽古意自泰。\n心清白雪照，兴逸朱霞会。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6542,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·汪编修琬","author":"徐元文","text":"汪翁钝自名，曾不乐宦达。\n平生无俗情，率尔自轩豁。\n真意安可渝，随人议疏阔。\n著书何沈深，直排古贤闼。\n山馆惬嘉赏，尘组犹屣脱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6543,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀贤诗·张知府鹏翮","author":"徐元文","text":"张侯王姿妙，潇洒自拔俗。\n惊人厉危操，适己澹群欲。\n挺节立郡朝，强直无蹙缩。\n吴趋攀素车，鲁郡明丹毂。\n何用美斯人，比德峚山玉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6544,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二给事诗·孙君蕙","author":"徐元文","text":"元叔赋《疾邪》，发音何煌煌。\n休琏感时俗，陈辞慨以慷。\n伊人负奇姿，奕奕黄门郎。\n激昂论意气，伉达上封章。\n嫉恶有本性，见之若探汤。\n作诗寓孤愤，属兴深且长。\n此意谁实谅，读之增感伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6545,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二给事诗·任君辰旦","author":"徐元文","text":"谀巧日以工，直谠道不存。\n圣明忠易效，曷不顾国恩。\n之子奋百里，高步登掖垣。\n职思在献纳，天关手欲扪。\n登祀谅非古，违众进苦言。\n艰哉松山役，慷慨声不吞。\n碌碌彼徒尔，遇合乌足论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6546,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江南三学使诗","author":"徐元文","text":"人心日已偷，士耻日已忘。\n郁彼礼义府，俄成赇赂场。\n楩梓谁为收，筐箧厚自将。\n因缘书上考，意气何轩昂。\n安知抱玉客，掩涕徒浪浪。\n吴都信多幸，衔使交琳琅。\n刘君奋才杰，高自标门墙。\n所过列巾卷，训饬故百方。\n田君夙英挺，若渴勤搜扬。\n文体一以变，流风为之昌。\n弭节未淹岁，矫矫立士坊。\n继以连城璧，温雅彰令望。\n采采深渊藻，灼灼茂林芳。\n人思肄朱弦，户有陈青箱。\n彼皆奋东国，身近邹鲁乡。\n圣泽虽已远，笃生尚材良。\n教术岂苟同，同于厉冰霜。\n足令振颓俗，姓氏余辉光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6547,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂感 其一","author":"徐元文","text":"云物苍凉禁御同，逼人秋气动遥空。\n铜池霤滴宵宵雨，金井梧飘叶叶风。\n秘阁几曾锵佩玉，缭垣时听响哀鸿。\n当年醉草青词处，满径苔衣锁碧宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6548,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂感 其二","author":"徐元文","text":"天兵万里播声灵，誓扫鲸鲵服不庭。\n催战正驰赤白羽，转输难论斗箕星。\n同时将帅推徐绩，盖代勋庸数卫青。\n文齿雕题拓地远，受降还拟到穷溟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6549,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂感 其三","author":"徐元文","text":"金风阊阖授衣初，陇亩荒芜足感歔。\n淮右人民祈石燕，江州车马就河鱼。\n大农孰问长平粟，左藏仍编会计书。\n但得政苛非猛虎，甘将膏血佐储胥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6550,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂感 其四","author":"徐元文","text":"梦到阖阊城外望，一天寒色满平芜。\n街调献辔严秋马，树绕将雏子夜乌。\n白羽将军初建节，青苗长吏正催租。\n庙堂自轸艰难意，谁绘流民入画图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6551,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村舍见红紫葵花开特可爱","author":"叶方霭","text":"插棘编荆茅舍清，此中谁拟见倾城。\n紫丝作障遮空暗，红锦裁衣曳地明。\n惆怅忽从攀处得，凄凉多为别时生。\n不须更结繁华梦，野蝶山蜂自有情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6552,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日","author":"叶方霭","text":"柳短闲莎长，春风触处狂。\n蝶飞遗剩粉，莺过炙新簧。\n银榼频倾酒，金炉满爇香。\n可容穷阮籍，一恸绮罗旁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6553,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日过邻院","author":"叶方霭","text":"山云禅榻静相因，偶为孤游得笑嚬。\n闲对景光真逝水，暗悲身世总流尘。\n频来檐鸟疑新主，别去庭花是故人。\n一阕渔歌数声笛，溪边林下转情亲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6554,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枯树","author":"叶方霭","text":"无复凌霄耸壑心，千寻落落卧幽岑。\n敢将荣悴争时代，独与岩流共古今。\n纵使帆来难近汉，便教斫就不堪琴。\n南朝名士虽工赋，未解庄休意更深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6555,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳","author":"叶方霭","text":"袅雨拖烟万万丝，秋来憔悴不胜悲。\n何人曾到灵和殿，记得君王手种时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6556,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"琼树","author":"叶方霭","text":"琼树何曾见一枝，纷靡众草竞英蕤。\n拟从骚客求兰佩，欲向灵妃问桂旗。\n天上只疑星是石，人间枉泣墨非丝。\n偶经抵鹊山前过，终古无端替玉悲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6557,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清江","author":"叶方霭","text":"清江水色碧于苔，南客扁舟北渡来。\n晓日未瞻鳷鹊观，阴云已满凤凰台。\n漫防酒醉先防醒，不怕花残却怕开。\n无限伤心还自语，此生终见太平回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6558,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将至辰山寄勿庵子","author":"叶方霭","text":"知近幽人住，溪流觉更清。\n偶随落花入，忽见群峰迎。\n石上迟谁酌，涧边遥独行。\n烟波三十里，无分与君争。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6559,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关陇平 其一","author":"叶方霭","text":"关岭茫茫，陇流汤汤。\n纡徐逶迤，峥嵘崄巇，面蜀肘凉，辅车相将。\n狡焉启疆，震惊我一方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6560,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关陇平 其二","author":"叶方霭","text":"关岭兀兀，陇流潏潏。\n彼泾启戎，乃蠢兹蟊贼。\n为虺为蜴，为螟为螣。\n昂首张臆，助逆抗有德。\n如猬之集，如豨之突。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6561,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关陇平 其三","author":"叶方霭","text":"泾原既清，群贼大睢睢盱盱，延旦夕之命。\n帝命臣海，为陇民徙灾。\n帝命臣勇，师出自西陲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6562,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关陇平 其四","author":"叶方霭","text":"帝诏臣海，汝速入坂。\n出彼朝那，为勇军援。\n犄之角之，沓之蹙之，除民之慝。\n俾妇子恬适，尚嘉乃绩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6563,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关陇平 其五","author":"叶方霭","text":"海涉河泾，言腾灞浐。\n秦山矗突，嵚崎陇坂。\n逾邠越凉，飞旓扬旆。\n扶舆猗靡，云罕綷䌨。\n雍部阻长，敢惮痡瘏。\n式遏寇虐，以宁尔室家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6564,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]